          "book": "GEN",
          "chapter": 40,
          "verse": 2
        }
      ],
      "en": "Pharaoh was angry with his two officers, the chief cup bearer and the chief baker.",
      "ko": "바로가 그 두 관원장 곧 술 맡은 관원장과 떡 굽는 관원장에게 노하여",
      "source_text_hash": "4f0ba6e8e9a88aa071bc4faac65a503d3ecf8ba5865ea6351c2bb746e9b789f6",
      "translation_text_hash": "230292b996475b60a57b97c5ae2dc4bc2c15d7f0dac51b77a4f8a074963aeb7f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "바로가 그 두 관원장 곧 술 맡은 관원장과 떡 굽는 관원장에게 노하여"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "230292b996475b60a57b97c5ae2dc4bc2c15d7f0dac51b77a4f8a074963aeb7f"
      ]
